n a `MultiMesh` at once, rather than calling individually _per instance_.\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n* I had been meaning to add this function for a while, there had been several requests to make things easier for bulk resetting.\r\n* The naming is slightly confusing, as we have `MultiMeshInstance` as a scene node, but the `MultiMesh` resource contains instances themselves (which are reset here), but that naming seems to have been set in stone historically and can't easily be changed now.\r\n* An alternative might be to call the functions `reset_all_instances...` rather than `reset_instances...`, given that the current is very similar to `reset_instance...` used already, am happy to change if this is preferred.\r\n* Also applicable in 3.x.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky